ned at","rect":[386.001,671.71,465.7799999999995,678.71],"fontSize":7},{"text":"<","rect":[467.4659,671.93,471.4679,677.93],"fontSize":6},{"text":"180/105 mm Hg for","rect":[471.3779,671.71,530.0658999999997,678.71],"fontSize":7},{"text":"at least the first 24 hours after IVT treatment.","rect":[385.99890000000005,662.7080000000001,513.5248999999992,669.7080000000001],"fontSize":7},{"text":"11–13","rect":[513.4198,665.68318,525.0710550000002,669.76418],"fontSize":4.081},{"text":"3: No","rect":[310.4486,631.46,327.8016,638.46],"fontSize":7},{"text":"Benefit","rect":[306.8786,622.4580000000001,331.3716,629.4580000000001],"fontSize":7},{"text":"B-R","rect":[347.9266,626.9590000000001,360.3166,633.9590000000001],"fontSize":7},{"text":"8.","rect":[379.75,649.46,385.434,656.46],"fontSize":7},{"text":"In patients with mild to moderate severity AIS","rect":[387.331,649.46,521.367,656.46],"fontSize":7},{"text":"who have been treated with IVT, intensive SBP","rect":[387.3308,640.46,526.0477000000001,647.46],"fontSize":7},{"text":"reduction (target of","rect":[387.3308,631.4580000000001,444.52009999999996,638.4580000000001],"fontSize":7},{"text":"<","rect":[446.4169,631.68,450.4189,637.68],"fontSize":6},{"text":"140 mm Hg compared","rect":[450.4189,631.46,518.3749,638.46],"fontSize":7},{"text":"with","rect":[387.3279,622.4580000000001,399.5779,629.4580000000001],"fontSize":7},{"text":"<","rect":[401.4776,622.68,405.4796,628.68],"fontSize":6},{"text":"180 mm Hg) is not recommended","rect":[405.4796,622.46,506.5526,629.46],"fontSize":7},{"text":"because it is not associated with an improve","rect":[387.3286,613.4580000000001,518.8796,620.4580000000001],"fontSize":7},{"text":"-","rect":[518.8796,613.4580000000001,520.9236,620.4580000000001],"fontSize":7},{"text":"ment in functional outcome.","rect":[387.3286,604.4560000000001,469.1656,611.4560000000001],"fontSize":7},{"text":"11","rect":[469.1668,607.43318,473.925246,611.51418],"fontSize":4.081},{"text":"After endovascular thrombectomy","rect":[305.75,591.21,405.815,598.21],"fontSize":7},{"text":"2a","rect":[315.116,568.957,323.131,575.957],"fontSize":7},{"text":"B-NR","rect":[345.22999999999996,568.957,363.01699999999994,575.957],"fontSize":7},{"text":"9.","rect":[379.75,577.96,385.434,584.96],"fontSize":7},{"text":"In patients who undergo EVT, it is reasonable to","rect":[387.331,577.96,528.815,584.96],"fontSize":7},{"text":"maintain BP at a level","rect":[387.3308,568.96,451.50609999999995,575.96],"fontSize":7},{"text":"≤","rect":[453.40309999999994,568.96,457.24609999999996,575.96],"fontSize":7},{"text":"180/105 mm Hg during","rect":[457.24609999999996,568.96,528.5410999999999,575.96],"fontSize":7},{"text":"and for 24 hours after the procedure.","rect":[387.3308,559.9580000000001,497.3218,566.9580000000001],"fontSize":7},{"text":"14–17","rect":[497.3203,562.93318,509.04909399999997,567.01418],"fontSize":4.081},{"text":"3: Harm","rect":[306.0736,519.71,332.1766,526.71],"fontSize":7},{"text":"A","rect":[351.6436,519.71,356.5996,526.71],"fontSize":7},{"text":"10.","rect":[375.75,546.71,385.515,553.71],"fontSize":7},{"text":"In patients with AIS with LVO of the anterior cir","rect":[387.412,546.71,526.1442999999999,553.71],"fontSize":7},{"text":"-","rect":[526.1428,546.71,528.1868,553.71],"fontSize":7},{"text":"culation who have been successfully recanalized","rect":[387.40979999999996,537.7080000000001,531.0638,544.7080000000001],"fontSize":7},{"text":"by endovascular therapy (mTICI 2b, 2c, or 3)","rect":[387.40979999999996,528.7060000000001,520.4153999999999,535.7060000000001],"fontSize":7},{"text":"and without other indication for blood pressure","rect":[387.40979999999996,519.7040000000002,526.2687999999999,526.7040000000002],"fontSize":7},{"text":"management target, intensive SBP reduction","rect":[387.40979999999996,510.70200000000017,520.7303999999999,517.7020000000002],"fontSize":7},{"text":"target of","rect":[387.40979999999996,501.70000000000016,412.50479999999993,508.70000000000016],"fontSize":7},{"text":"<","rect":[414.4034,501.93,418.4054,507.93],"fontSize":6},{"text":"140 mm Hg for the first 72 hours is","rect":[418.4053,501.71,523.2778999999999,508.71],"fontSize":7},{"text":"harmful and not recommended.","rect":[387.40930000000003,492.70799999999997,479.8863,499.70799999999997],"fontSize":7},{"text":"18–21","rect":[479.8878,495.68318,491.78391500000004,499.76418],"fontSize":4.081},{"text":"Synopsis","rect":[301.5,465.925,341.9,475.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"In adult patients with AIS, there is a general, mechanistic","rect":[301.5,453.925,535.5300000000001,463.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"understanding that extremely high BP concurrent with","rect":[301.5,441.925,535.4900000000002,451.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"acute stroke reperfusion may be detrimental, particularly","rect":[301.5,429.925,535.5199999999999,439.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"in terms of hemorrhagic complications. The majority of","rect":[301.5,417.925,535.52,427.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"evidence supporting pre-reperfusion BP reduction has","rect":[301.5,405.925,535.5200000000002,415.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"either been observational or based on thrombolysis or","rect":[301.5,393.925,535.5250000000002,403.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"thrombectomy RCT protocols. Randomized trials evalu","rect":[301.5,381.925,531.9400000000002,391.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[531.96,381.925,535.5,391.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"ating pre-thrombolysis or pre-thrombectomy BP targets","rect":[301.50000000000006,369.925,535.5200000000002,379.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"are yet unavailable.","rect":[301.50000000000006,357.925,380.68,367.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Optimal BP targets after IVT and thrombectomy con","rect":[313.50000000000006,345.925,531.9800000000002,355.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[531.96,345.925,535.5,355.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"tinue to be actively studied because of the known and","rect":[301.50000000000006,333.925,535.47,343.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"hypothesized associations with either sICH from hyper","rect":[301.50000000000006,321.925,531.9639999999999,331.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[531.9639999999996,321.925,535.5039999999996,331.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"perfusion or worsened cerebral ischemia from hypoper","rect":[301.50000000000006,309.925,531.96,319.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[531.9599999999996,309.925,535.4999999999995,319.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"fusion, as well as with outcomes including death and","rect":[301.50000000000006,297.925,535.4700000000003,307.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"dependency. The recommendation for BP targets after","rect":[301.50000000000006,285.925,535.5000000000001,295.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"IVT and thrombectomy remains largely unchanged from","rect":[301.50000000000006,273.925,535.4900000000001,283.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"previous guidelines, with further evidence that more","rect":[301.50000000000006,261.925,535.5100000000003,271.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"intensive BP reduction provides either no benefit in func","rect":[301.50000000000006,249.925,531.9800000000002,259.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[531.96,249.925,535.5,259.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"tional outcome (thrombolysis) or harm (thrombectomy).","rect":[301.50000000000006,237.925,529.489,247.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Recommendation-Specific Supportive Text","rect":[301.50000000000006,216.925,491.9280000000001,226.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"1.","rect":[311.6,204.925,319.1,214.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Observational studies are conflicted, with associa","rect":[326,204.925,532.039999999999,214.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[531.9601,204.925,535.5001,214.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"tions found between worse outcomes and lower","rect":[326.0001,192.925,535.4800999999993,202.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"BP.","rect":[326.0001,180.925,339.78009999999995,190.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"1–3,22","rect":[339.6798,185.1724,357.3563600000001,191.00240000000002],"fontSize":5.83},{"text":"No studies have addressed the treatment of","rect":[359.40770000000003,180.925,535.4876999999994,190.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"low BP in patients with stroke. In a systematic analy","rect":[325.9977,168.925,532.0566999999992,178.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[531.9566999999989,168.925,535.4966999999989,178.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"sis of 12 studies comparing the use of IV colloids","rect":[325.9977,156.925,535.5276999999993,166.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"and crystalloids, the odds of death or dependence","rect":[325.9977,144.925,535.4976999999993,154.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"were similar. Clinically important benefits or harms","rect":[325.9977,132.925,535.5176999999994,142.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"could not be excluded. There are no data to guide","rect":[325.9977,120.925,535.5076999999994,130.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"volume and duration of parenteral fluid delivery.","rect":[325.9977,108.925,514.5436999999995,118.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"23","rect":[514.4446,113.1724,521.18408,119.0024],"fontSize":5.83},{"text":"No","rect":[523.3107,108.925,535.5006999999999,118.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"studies have compared different isotonic fluids.","rect":[325.99570000000006,96.925,516.7656999999995,106.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"2.","rect":[311.6001,84.925,319.1001,94.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Patients with AIS can present with severe acute","rect":[326.0001,84.925,535.5201000000001,94.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"comorbidities, such as acute heart failure and aor","rect":[326.0001,72.925,531.9701,82.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[531.9601,72.925,535.5001,82.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"tic dissection, which require emergency BP reduc","rect":[326.0001,60.925,531.9801000000001,70.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[531.9601,60.925,535.5001,70.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"tion to prevent worsening of these conditions or","rect":[326.0001,48.925,535.5201000000001,58.925],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Recommendations for Blood Pressure Management (Continued)","rect":[305.501,711.585,520.7362999999998,718.585],"fontSize":7},{"text":"COR","rect":[311.22,698.3340000000001,326.536,705.3340000000001],"fontSize":7},{"text":"LOE","rect":[347.018,698.3340000000001,360.738,705.3340000000001],"fontSize":7},{"text":"Recommendations","rect":[375.501,698.3340000000001,438.347,705.3340000000001],"fontSize":7},{"text":"Downloaded from http://ahajournals.org by on August 3, 2026","rect":[18.24,291.39599999999996,26.24,491.604],"fontSize":8}],"segments":[[33.5749989,624.75,33.5749989,720.75],[21.5749989,732.75,-19.8000011,732.75],[-31.8000011,720.75,-31.8000011,624.75],[-19.8000011,612.75,21.5749989,612.75],[49.5,731,283.5,731],[301.5,731,535.5,731],[49.625,445.435,283.375,445.435],[283.375,445.435,283.375,413.378],[283.375,413.378,49.625,413.378],[49.625,413.378,49.625,445.435],[49.625,413.378,84.625,413.378],[84.625,413.378,84.625,400.128],[84.625,400.128,49.625,400.128],[49.625,400.128,49.625,413.378],[84.625,413.378,119.625,413.378],[119.625,413.378,119.625,400.128],[119.625,400.128,84.625,400.128],[84.625,400.128,84.625,413.378],[119.625,413.378,283.375,413.378],[283.375,413.378,283.375,400.128],[283.375,400.128,119.625,400.128],[119.625,400.128,119.625,413.378],[49.625,400.128,283.375,400.128],[283.375,400.128,283.375,386.878],[283.375,386.878,49.625,386.878],[49.625,386.878,49.625,400.128],[49.625,171.878,283.375,171.878],[283.375,171.878,283.375,158.628],[283.375,158.628,49.625,158.628],[49.625,158.628,49.625,171.878],[49.625,386.878,84.625,386.878],[84.625,386.878,84.625,355.628],[84.625,355.628,49.625,355.628],[49.625,355.628,49.625,386.878],[49.625,355.628,84.625,355.628],[84.625,355.628,84.625,297.378],[84.625,297.378,49.625,297.378],[49.625,297.378,49.625,355.628],[49.625,158.628,84.625,158.628],[84.625,158.628,84.625,100.37799999999999],[84.625,100.37799999999999,49.625,100.37799999999999],[49.625,100.37799999999999,49.625,158.628],[84.625,38